## About the standard

PCI DSS defines twelve requirement areas for organisations that store, process or transmit cardholder data. The standard is published by the PCI Security Standards Council; the current version 4.0.1 was released in 2024. The standard text is obtained from the PCI SSC document library.

Official source: [PCI DSS v4.0.1](https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/standards/pci-dss/).
